ick to enlarge.</span><span class="gallery-help-mobile">Swipe to explore · Tap an image to enlarge.</span></p><div class="gallery-assurances-slot" id="gallery-assurances-slot"><div class="assurances" id="purchase-assurances" role="group" aria-label="Delivery, warranty and product support"><details name="g31-assurance" data-assurance-key="0"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 20 6v5c0 5-3.4 8.5-8 10-4.6-1.5-8-5-8-10V6z"></path><path d="m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.8-5"></path></svg><span><strong>5-year warranty</strong><small>Coverage follows the G31 model terms.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>5-year warranty</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close 5-year warranty details">×</button></div><p>Five years from delivery for manufacturing defects and component failure under normal use. Keep your proof of purchase and follow the model instructions.</p><a href="/pages/warranty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Warranty &amp; service details ↗</a></div></details><details name="g31-assurance" data-assurance-key="1"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16v12H4z"></path><path d="m4 10 8 4 8-4M8 5h8"></path></svg><span><strong>14-Day Returns</strong><small>Request an eligible return within 14 days after delivery.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>14-Day Returns</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close 14-Day Returns details">×</button></div><p>Contact us for approval and an RMA before shipping. Return eligibility and shipping costs follow the return policy.</p><a href="/pages/return-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the return policy ↗</a></div></details><details name="g31-assurance" data-assurance-key="2"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v10H3zM14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"></path><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"></circle></svg><span><strong>U.S. Warehouse Delivery</strong><small>Eligible stocked products ship domestically.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>U.S. Warehouse Delivery</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close U.S. Warehouse Delivery details">×</button></div><p>Allow 2 business days for processing, plus an estimated 2–5 business days in transit after dispatch. Business days are Monday–Friday, excluding public holidays. Delivery estimates are not guaranteed.</p><a href="/pages/shipping-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Review shipping details ↗</a></div></details><details name="g31-assurance" data-assurance-key="3"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h18M12 3v18M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"></path></svg><span><strong>Free U.S. Shipping</strong><small>Standard shipping to the contiguous 48 states and DC.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>Free U.S. Shipping</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close Free U.S. Shipping details">×</button></div><p>Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, other U.S. territories, military addresses and destinations outside the U.S. are excluded.</p><a href="/pages/shipping-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See eligibility ↗</a></div></details><details name="g31-assurance" data-assurance-key="4"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v12H8l-4 4zM8 9h8M8 13h5"></path></svg><span><strong>Product Support</strong><small>Help with product selection, setup and use.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>Product Support</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close Product Support details">×</button></div><p>Tell us the model and your question. For an order or service issue, include your order number and clear photos where useful.</p><a href="/pages/support-rv-g31" target="_blank" rel="noopener">G31 product support ↗</a></div></details></div></div></div>
    <div class="product-summary" id="sales-summary">
      <p class="eyebrow">SUNTNEEW / GROUP 31</p><h1 id="product-title">Group 31<br> LiFePO4 RV Battery</h1>
      <p class="product-spec-line">12.8V · 100Ah · 1,280Wh · Bluetooth</p>
      {%- assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value -%}{%- assign review_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | default: 0 -%}{%- if rating != blank and review_count > 0 -%}<a class="rating-link" href="#reviews"><span class="stars" aria-label="{{ rating.rating }} out of {{ rating.scale_max }} stars">★★★★★</span><strong>{{ rating.rating | round: 1 }}</strong><span>{{ 'product.rating_count' | t: count: review_count }}</span></a>{%- endif -%}
      
      <p class="product-description">House power for the road. Deep-cycle power for the water. One lighter battery for your next setup.</p>
      <ul class="product-highlights" aria-label="Product highlights"><li><span><strong>Power for the way you travel.</strong> 12.8V 100Ah and 1,280Wh for RV house loads, compatible trolling motors and solar storage.</span></li><li><span><strong>A quick check from your phone.</strong> Bluetooth monitoring puts charge level, voltage, current and temperature close at hand.</span></li><li><span><strong>Built for repeat trips.</strong> LiFePO4 cells rated for 4,000+ cycles at 100% depth of discharge.</span></li><li><span><strong>Protection built in.</strong> 100A BMS, low-temperature charge protection and an IP65 enclosure.</span></li><li><span><strong>Lighter to lift. Room to expand.</strong> About 21.2 lb, with support for matched batteries in up to a 4P4S bank.</span></li></ul>
      <div class="sn-pack-total" id="main-price" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><p class="sn-pack-total__label">Total price</p><div class="sn-pack-total__amounts"><strong id="total-price">{{ selected_variant.price | money }}</strong><del id="compare-price" hidden></del><span>{{ cart.currency.iso_code | default: shop.currency }}</span></div><p class="sn-pack-total__saving" id="total-saving" hidden></p></div>
      <p class="product-tax">Taxes calculated at checkout.</p>
