  <nav class="product-nav content" aria-label="Product information"><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#specs">Specifications</a><a href="#box">In the box</a><a href="#manuals">User Manual</a><a href="#reviews">Reviews</a><a href="#support">Support</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></nav>
  <div class="intro content" id="features"><p class="eyebrow">GROUP 31 / AT HOME OFF THE GRID</p><h2 class="features-title">Power for wherever you park.</h2><p class="lead">A closer look at the battery behind your next trip.</p></div>
  <div id="feature-content" aria-busy="false"><section class="feature-opening" data-group="01"><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A02" aria-label="Enlarge G31 features at a glance image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a02.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — G31 features at a glance" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></section><section class="feature-section" data-group="02"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / MADE FOR REPEAT TRIPS</p><h2>More trips between battery replacements.</h2><p>From weekend camping to days on the water, G31 is built for repeated deep-cycle use. Its LiFePO4 cells are rated for 4,000+ cycles at 100% depth of discharge.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A03" aria-label="Enlarge LiFePO4 cells and cycle life image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a03.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — LiFePO4 cells and cycle life" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><p class="support-text">Cycle-life references: 4,000+ cycles at 100% DoD, 6,000 at 80% DoD and 15,000 at 60% DoD. Actual life depends on charging, temperature and use.</p></section><section class="feature-section" data-group="03"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / CHECK FROM YOUR PHONE</p><h2>Know what’s left before you head out.</h2><p>Check charge level, voltage, current and temperature through the Bluetooth connection. A quick look at your phone helps you plan the next leg of the trip.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A04" aria-label="Enlarge Bluetooth battery monitoring image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a04.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — Bluetooth battery monitoring" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></section><section class="feature-section" data-group="04"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">03 / BUILT-IN PROTECTION</p><h2>Ready for changing conditions.</h2><p>The 100A BMS monitors charging and discharge, with protection against overcharge, over-discharge, overcurrent and short circuits. Low-temperature charge protection helps protect the cells when the weather turns cold.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A05" aria-label="Enlarge 100A BMS protections image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a05.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — 100A BMS protections" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A08" aria-label="Enlarge Temperature limits and IP65 enclosure image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a08.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — Temperature limits and IP65 enclosure" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><p class="support-text">IP65 protects against dust and water jets; it is not an immersion rating. Charging: 32°F–131°F (0°C–55°C). Discharging: −4°F–140°F (−20°C–60°C).</p></section><section class="feature-section" data-group="05"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / ROOM TO GROW</p><h2>Build the battery bank your setup needs.</h2><p>Start with one 12.8V 100Ah battery, then expand with matched batteries as your power needs grow. G31 supports up to four in series and four in parallel, with a maximum 4P4S configuration.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A06" aria-label="Enlarge Series and parallel battery banks image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a06.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — Series and parallel battery banks" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><p class="support-text">Use matched batteries and follow the manual for balancing, wiring and system protection. Maximum 4P4S bank: 51.2V 400Ah (20.48kWh).</p></section><section class="feature-section" data-group="06"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">05 / EASIER TO HANDLE</p><h2>Less weight in the battery bay.</h2><p>At about 21.2 lb, G31 is easier to lift, position and install. Check the 13.34 × 7.28 × 8.58 in case dimensions, terminal clearance and hold-down before ordering.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A09" aria-label="Enlarge Weight and lead-acid comparison image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a09.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — Weight and lead-acid comparison" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></section><section class="feature-section" data-group="07"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">06 / RECHARGE YOUR WAY</p><h2>Plug in. Drive on. Catch some sun.</h2><p>Recharge through a compatible LiFePO4 charger, solar charge controller or DC-to-DC charging setup. Choose the right equipment and charging profile for your system.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A10" aria-label="Enlarge Three compatible charging methods image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a10.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — Three compatible charging methods" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><p class="support-text">Use 14.4–14.6V LiFePO4 charging. Solar panels and a vehicle alternator require suitable charging equipment; do not connect them directly to the battery.</p></section><section class="feature-section" data-group="08"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">07 / TAKE YOUR POWER FURTHER</p><h2>For the campsite, the lake and beyond.</h2><p>Keep RV house loads, a compatible trolling motor or an off-grid solar setup supplied. G31 provides 1,280Wh of nominal stored energy in each battery.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A11" aria-label="Enlarge RV and trolling motor applications image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a11.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — RV and trolling motor applications" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A12" aria-label="Enlarge Solar storage and outdoor power image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a12.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — Solar storage and outdoor power" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><p class="support-text">For auxiliary and energy-storage use. G31 is not an engine-starting battery. Runtime depends on the load and system losses.</p></section><section class="feature-section" data-group="09"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">08 / BEFORE YOU INSTALL</p><h2>Get to know your G31.</h2><p>Check the model documents, charging requirements and installation instructions before building your system. Our product support team can help with setup questions.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" data-image-id="A15" aria-label="Enlarge G31 product document references image"><img src={{ 'sn-g31-selected-a15.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1464" height="600" alt="SuntNeew G31 — G31 product document references" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></section></div>
  <section class="pdp-section detail-grid" id="specs"><div><p class="eyebrow">KNOW YOUR G31</p><h2>Check the fit.<br>Plan your system.</h2><p class="section-intro">Key dimensions and ratings for your installation.</p><a class="text-link" href="#manuals">Manuals &amp; documents →</a></div><div><dl class="spec-table"><div><dt>Cell chemistry</dt><dd>LiFePO4</dd></div><div><dt>Rated voltage</dt><dd>12.8V</dd></div><div><dt>Rated capacity</dt><dd>100Ah</dd></div><div><dt>Rated energy</dt><dd>1,280Wh</dd></div><div><dt>Dimensions (L × W × H)</dt><dd>339 × 185 × 218mm / 13.34 × 7.28 × 8.58in</dd></div><div><dt>Weight</dt><dd>9.6kg / 21.16lb</dd></div></dl><details class="more-details"><summary>More specifications</summary><dl class="spec-table"><div><dt>Maximum continuous output power</dt><dd>1,280W</dd></div><div><dt>Cycle-life reference at 100% DoD</dt><dd>4,000+ cycles</dd></div><div><dt>Cycle-life reference at 80% DoD</dt><dd>6,000 cycles</dd></div><div><dt>Cycle-life reference at 60% DoD</dt><dd>15,000 cycles</dd></div><div><dt>Product-life reference</dt><dd>Up to 10 years; actual life varies by operating conditions</dd></div><div><dt>Model / site name</dt><dd>Group 31 / ESS-12.8V100AH-B-G31 / ESS-LFP12100BG31</dd></div><div><dt>FCC ID</dt><dd>2BQK7-12100BG31</dd></div><div><dt>Charge method</dt><dd>CC/CV</dd></div><div><dt>Charge voltage</dt><dd>14.4V ±0.2V</dd></div><div><dt>Recommended charge current</dt><dd>30A (0.3C)</dd></div><div><dt>Charge cut-off voltage</dt><dd>14.6V; do not exceed</dd></div><div><dt>Maximum continuous discharge current</dt><dd>100A</dd></div><div><dt>Wireless monitoring</dt><dd>Bluetooth 5.0</dd></div><div><dt>BMS protection</dt><dd>Low-temperature charge, overcharge, over-discharge, over-current protection listed at 110A ±5A, short-circuit and over-temperature protection</dd></div><div><dt>Series / parallel expansion</dt><dd>Up to 4S or 4P; up to 16 matched batteries in 4P4S</dd></div><div><dt>Housing material</dt><dd>ABS</dd></div><div><dt>Terminal hardware</dt><dd>M8 × 12mm positive and negative terminal bolts</dd></div><div><dt>Recommended terminal torque</dt><dd>12–14N·m / 106.2–123.9in-lb</dd></div><div><dt>Enclosure protection</dt><dd>IP65 — dust-tight and protected against water jets; not for immersion</dd></div><div><dt>Temperature ranges</dt><dd>Charge 0–55°C; discharge -20–60°C; storage -10–50°C; charging resumes above 5°C after low-temperature protection</dd></div></dl></details><details class="more-details" id="manuals"><summary>Manuals &amp; documents</summary><div class="manual-list"><a href="{{ 'suntneew-rv-g31-manual-en-fr-de.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Group 31 user manual · EN / FR / DE (PDF) ↗</a><a href="/pages/support-rv-g31#certifications" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Model documents &amp; compliance references ↗</a></div></details></div></section>
  <section class="pdp-section detail-grid" id="box"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR KIT</p><h2>What comes with your G31.</h2><p class="section-intro">Package contents listed per battery.</p></div><div><ul class="package-list"><li><span class="item-number">01</span><span>Group 31 LiFePO4 battery × 1</span></li><li><span class="item-number">02</span><span>Terminal screws × 2</span></li><li><span class="item-number">03</span><span>Terminal washers × 2</span></li><li><span class="item-number">04</span><span>Insulating caps × 2</span></li><li><span class="item-number">05</span><span>User manual × 1</span></li></ul><p class="package-note" id="box-quantity-note">Package contents listed per battery.</p></div></section>
  <section class="pdp-section" id="reviews" aria-label="Customer reviews">{% for block in section.blocks %}{% if block.type == '@app' %}{% render block %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</section>
  <section class="support-section" id="support"><div class="pdp-section support-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">SUNTNEEW, AFTER THE SALE</p><span class="warranty-number">5<small>YEAR</small></span><h2>Here for the road ahead.</h2><p class="support-copy">A five-year limited warranty for eligible defects under normal use, with product support for setup and use.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pages/warranty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Warranty &amp; service details ↗</a></div><div class="support-links"><a href="/pages/shipping-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><strong>Free U.S. standard shipping.</strong><small>To the contiguous 48 states and Washington, DC.</small></span><span class="link-arrow">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/return-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><strong>14 days to request a return.</strong><small>Contact us for approval before returning eligible items.</small></span><span class="link-arrow">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/support-rv-g31" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><strong>Questions now. Support later.</strong><small>Help with product selection, setup and use.</small></span><span class="link-arrow">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Talk to SuntNeew</strong><span class="link-arrow">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="pdp-section detail-grid" id="faq"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU GO</p><h2>A few useful answers.</h2><p class="section-intro">More questions about your G31?</p><a class="text-link" href="/pages/support-rv-g31" target="_blank" rel="noopener">We’re here to help ↗</a></div><div class="faq-group"><details><summary>Can this battery start my RV engine?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>No. G31 is a LiFePO4 deep-cycle battery for auxiliary and energy-storage systems. It is not an engine-starting battery.</p></div></details><details><summary>Will it fit every Group 31 battery tray?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Check the 339 × 185 × 218mm case dimensions, hold-down arrangement, terminal access and cable clearance. Group size alone does not confirm physical fit.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I use my existing lead-acid charger?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Use compatible 14.4–14.6V LiFePO4 charging as specified in the manual. A charger with a lead-acid-only mode may not be suitable.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I charge it below freezing?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>The low-temperature protection stops charging below 0°C (32°F); charging resumes above 5°C (41°F). It does not heat the battery. Follow the temperature limits in the manual.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does IP65 mean the battery can be submerged?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>No. IP65 covers dust and water-jet protection under the applicable rating conditions. It is not an immersion rating.</p></div></details></div></section>
  <section class="closing-banner"><div><p class="eyebrow">SUNTNEEW / GROUP 31</p><h2>Make more of the road.</h2></div><a class="orange-link" href="#sales-summary">Choose your G31 ↑</a></section>
